  "fullDescription": "Brushes are pressure and tilt sensitive to give you precise control and a natural drawing experience, allowing for varied line thickness and shading based on your hand movements. Sketchbook brushes are great for sketching, drawing, outlining. From sketch to fine lines and details. Line work and shading, coloring, filling, halftones.\n\nFeaturing 20 pen pressure-sensitive brushes, this versatile collection includes sketch, outline, marker, pencil, and charcoal brushes, along with watercolor, shading, halftone, and splatter brushes. Perfect for creating detailed and expressive artwork, these brushes are designed to give you a natural and intuitive drawing experience on Procreate.\n\nSketchbook Procreate Brushes Set:\n• 3 Sketch brushes\n• 3 Outline brushes\n• 3 Marker brushes\n• 3 Halftone brushes\n• 3 Splatter brushes\n• Pencil, charcoal brushes\n• Watercolor and shading brushes\n• 20 Pen pressure sensitive brushes in total\n\nAlso, you’ll get .procreate file. The canvas includes realistic paper textures, providing a lifelike look and feel to your digital drawings for a more authentic artistic experience.\n\nHow To Use:\n1. Download the files on your iPad\n2. Click on .brushset files\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list",
